"X-Piwigo-Zero-Plural: false\n"

msgid "PHP 5 is required"
msgstr "Zahtevan je PHP 5.2"

msgid "Password [confirm]"
msgstr "Geslo [potrdi]"

msgid "Piwigo may try to switch your configuration to PHP 5 by creating or modifying a .htaccess file."
msgstr "Piwigo bo poskušal preklopiti vaše nastavitve na PHP 5.2 z ustvarjanjem ali urejanjem .htacceess datoteke"

msgid "Piwigo was not able to configure PHP 5."
msgstr "Piwigo ni mogel nastaviti PHP 5.2"

msgid "Sorry!"
msgstr "Oprostite!"

msgid "Start Install"
msgstr "Začni namestitev"

msgid "Try to configure PHP 5"
msgstr "Poskušam nastaviti PHP 5.2"

msgid "User"
msgstr "Uporabnik"

msgid "Visitors will be able to contact site administrator with this mail"
msgstr "Obiskovalci bodo lahko ta elektronski naslov uporabljali za kontakt s skrbnikom spletne strani "

msgid "Welcome to my photo gallery"
msgstr "Dobrodošli v moji foto galeriji"

msgid "Welcome to your new installation of Piwigo!"
msgstr "Dobrodošli v vaši novi namestitvi Piwigo!"

msgid "You can download the config file and upload it to local/config directory of your installation."
msgstr "Lahko prenesete namestitveno datoteko ter jo naložite v local/config imenik vaše namestitve."

msgid "Admin configuration"
msgstr "Admin nastavitve"

msgid "Basic configuration"
msgstr "Osnovne nastavitve"

msgid "Can't connect to server"
msgstr "Ne morem se povezati s strežnikom"

msgid "Congratulations, Piwigo installation is completed"
msgstr "Čestitamo! Namestitev Piwigo aplikacije je uspešno dokončana!"

msgid "Connection to server succeed, but it was impossible to connect to database"
msgstr "Uspešno ste se povezali na strežnik vendar je povezava s podatkovno bazo spodletela."

msgid "Creation of config file local/config/database.inc.php failed."
msgstr "Ustvarjanje nastavitvene datoteke local/config/database.inc.php je spodletelo."

msgid "Database configuration"
msgstr "Nastavitve podatkovne baze"

msgid "Database name"
msgstr "Ime podatkovne baze"

msgid "Database table prefix"
msgstr "Predpona podatkovnih tabel"

msgid "Default gallery language"
msgstr "Privzeti jezik galerije"

msgid "Don't hesitate to consult our forums for any help : %s"
msgstr "Ne oklevajte in povprašajte za pomoč na našem forumu: %s"

msgid "Download the config file"
msgstr "Prenesite config datoteko"

msgid "Hope to see you back soon."
msgstr "Upam, da se kmalu ponovno vidimo."

msgid "Host"
msgstr "Gostitelj"

msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Namestitev"

msgid "It appears your webhost is currently running PHP %s."
msgstr "Zdi se, da  je na spletnem strežniku trenutno nameščen PHP %s"

msgid "It will be shown to the visitors. It is necessary for website administration"
msgstr "Vidno bo obiskovalcem. To je potrebno za upravljanje spletne strani"

msgid "Just another Piwigo gallery"
msgstr "To je zgolj še ena Piwigo galerija"

msgid "enter a login for webmaster"
msgstr "vnesite prijavno ime skrbnika"

msgid "please enter your password again"
msgstr "prosimo ponovno vnesite vaše geslo"

msgid "user login given by your host provider"
msgstr "prijavno ime uporabnika pridobljeno od vašega ponudnika gostovanja"

msgid "user password given by your host provider"
msgstr "geslo uporabnika pridobljeno od vašega ponudnika gostovanja"

msgid "verification"
msgstr "preverjanje"

msgid "webmaster login can't contain characters ' or \""
msgstr "prijavno ime skrbnika ne sme vsebovati znakov ' ali \""

msgid "database tables names will be prefixed with it (enables you to manage better your tables)"
msgstr "imena tabel v podatkovni bazi bodo imela predpono. (omogoča lažje upravljanje tabel)"

msgid "You may referer to your hosting provider's support and see how you could switch to PHP 5 by yourself."
msgstr "Posvetujte se z vašim ponudnikom gostovanja kako bi lahko sami prešli na zahtevano PHP 5.2 različico."

msgid "also given by your host provider"
msgstr "tudi pridobljeno od vašega ponudnika gostovanja"

msgid "Need help ? Ask your question on <a href=\"%s\">Piwigo message board</a>."
msgstr "Potrebujete dodatno pomoč? Zastavite vprašanje na <a href=\"%s\">Piwigo oglasni deski</a>."

msgid "Note you can change your configuration by yourself and restart Piwigo after that."
msgstr "Upoštevajte da lahko sami spremenite nastavitve in nato ponovno zaženete Piwigo."

msgid "An alternate solution is to copy the text in the box above and paste it into the file \"local/config/database.inc.php\" (Warning : database.inc.php must only contain what is in the textarea, no line return or space character)"
msgstr "Druga rešitev je, da kopirate besedilo v polje zgoraj in ga prilepite v datoteko \"local/config/database.inc.php\" (Opozorilo: database.inc.php mora vsebovati le to kar je v besedilnem polju, brez znakov prehoda v novo vrstico(line return)ali znakov za presledke)"

msgid "Keep it confidential, it enables you to access administration panel"
msgstr "Varno shranite, omogoča vam dostop do administratorske nadzorne plošče!"

msgid "localhost or other, supplied by your host provider"
msgstr "localhost ali drug naslov ki ga imate pri svojem ponudniku gostovanja"

msgid "PHP version %s required (you are running on PHP %s)"
msgstr "Zahtevana je različica PHP %s (izvajate v PHP %s) "

